{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "003hok_402_2_4_003_02_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:0372321904e769418fc9f8296401c45152ab41e7cf512c422999be5c96c4ee5f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:003hok_402_2_4_003_02_09_b:2_4_003_02_09_b:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f2c4bc4a51b259e8395ae22e485e8609d5dedf3f0d1faccbd82e0601098da98",
      "text": "晚上好，●●●●プロデューサー。\n辛苦了。现在方便说话吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:003hok_402_2_4_003_02_09_b:2_4_003_02_09_b:cmd-000008:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3824963c3bf22de656395842398d70ad8a3b06021e9eb394c723580744fb9d53",
      "text": "我在事务所哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:003hok_402_2_4_003_02_09_b:2_4_003_02_09_b:cmd-000009:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:676785f5c9daf9c6d5655c4c7640e6b9d80653c50981ad3ad2c3ac9e0f435ac8",
      "text": "刚才在工作。\n怎么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:003hok_402_2_4_003_02_09_b:2_4_003_02_09_b:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da28444e4a3628affda3e115461622f3d61da55864855ec523d7f03433ddc43a",
      "text": "这么晚还在忙，真是辛苦你了。\n请让我稍微跟你说两句吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:003hok_402_2_4_003_02_09_b:2_4_003_02_09_b:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8356b25ae6d44efbdcdf595320bc35e57280e0810beca3c5d72c3f8907e6050",
      "text": "直到刚才，我还和冬马、翔太一起\n回顾了至今为止的工作。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:003hok_402_2_4_003_02_09_b:2_4_003_02_09_b:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0258b3ba41d9edbc0cdb69612e570d58b02248f6460e8022e422eca99604fa59",
      "text": "那个时候，聊到了承蒙制作人\n关照良多的事情。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:003hok_402_2_4_003_02_09_b:2_4_003_02_09_b:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb84d69c847f568e47a447865454072c1f91ae7cd3072bf1b08963fd7c2f4b33",
      "text": "正是因为与你相遇，我们才得以体验了许多事，\n见到了许多风景。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:003hok_402_2_4_003_02_09_b:2_4_003_02_09_b:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a3c8265d69e0091ac305bf7a35b89f7493b91ea351dc33342ad43bc2504e9bfd",
      "text": "谢谢你。为了能报答这份恩情，\n我们今后也会继续努力。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:003hok_402_2_4_003_02_09_b:2_4_003_02_09_b:cmd-000022:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:950ebd0148f2501f08e410bbb5d252fe4361ddd40f426551b1394e275dd30260",
      "text": "今后也请\n多多关照",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:003hok_402_2_4_003_02_09_b:2_4_003_02_09_b:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:355fb631c33ea9f5986d5b791706c0e5dc98637f88eb088e275fa413d28925e9",
      "text": "好的。……哎呀。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:003hok_402_2_4_003_02_09_b:2_4_003_02_09_b:cmd-000029:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a2be5b686da7e8e3f207954b437ac240266aa698ec4c9704d9b822e0567ad95",
      "text": "……冬马他们好像醒了，\n我差不多就先告辞了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:003hok_402_2_4_003_02_09_b:2_4_003_02_09_b:cmd-000031:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8af3c898cd63a538e0242e4f2ad0043f73663906d9281a38f4765837adb3f342",
      "text": "今晚也很冷，回去的路上请多加小心。\n那么，晚安。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
